WEBVTT

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:38.760
Go, Shoot!

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:44.130
Go, Galeon!

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:45.830
Not good enough!

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:52.560
Rei!

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:56.570
Go, Driger!

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:03.360
Too weak!

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:06.850
The world championships
are on a much higher level!

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:20.420
That dream again...

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:51.560
I'm still not good enough.
That's why I had that dream.

00:02:55.970 --> 00:02:58.560
Go!!

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:01.680
Rei, I don't want
to hold you back.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:14.980
I have to get stronger.

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:28.120
Rai...

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:36.200
It's the third day
of the tournament.

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:40.920
It is. Pressure is building on
the teams with winning records.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:45.540
Conversely, teams with losing
records are defiant yet relaxed.

00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:59.260
The battles are
about to intensify.

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:00.080
Yes.

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:05.860
And well, about F-Sangre's
request for a four-man battle...

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:08.020
What do you
think about it?

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:10.960
I think it's best to stick
to the official rules.

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:12.100
I see...

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:18.380
However, it's the Bladers that battle.
If they're all okay with it...

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:21.400
It might not be a bad idea
to approve a four-man battle.

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:26.490
I'm of the same opinion.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:31.770
Beyblade belongs to the people
who love it all over the world.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:49.770
Come on, Gao!
Stop eating and give me a hand!

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:52.700
I'm eating with my hands,
isn't that good enough?

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:56.340
What should I take next?

00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:57.680
This looks goo--

00:04:57.680 --> 00:04:59.500
That's enough!

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:03.340
Oh, right.
I'll be right back!

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.730
Need protein.

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:07.250
This one, please!

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:14.210
Couldn't sleep?

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:17.540
No. But I'm fine.

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:19.130
Really? But...

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:23.530
Don't worry. I'll do my best not
to drag you down today.

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:25.470
Sorry for the wait!

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:27.170
Here you go Rai!

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:28.720
So much!

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:30.170
You made a lot...

00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:32.650
It's because you've been
so worn out lately, Rai!

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:34.850
It doesn't look like you've
been sleeping well.

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:37.720
So maybe eating will
give you some energy?

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:40.170
You all worry too much.

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:44.260
Eat up!

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:46.820
Eating this'll make your
exhaustion fly away!

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:47.930
Really?

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:52.170
It's an energy pill made from
geckos, centipedes, and pill bugs!

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:56.120
Geckos, centipedes,
and pill bugs?!

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:58.620
Time to eat!

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:08.090
Hurry!

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:10.810
Don't pull so hard!

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:14.880
Rai, why are you
hiding it from me?

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:17.880
You've been
sighing a lot lately.

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:19.760
Not really.

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:21.000
Oh?

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:23.360
They're a good team now.

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:25.050
Sometimes I wonder...

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:26.860
Am I wrong?

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:30.130
Oh, no, it's nothing!

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:32.180
Hurry up, Rei!

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:34.120
Nothing, he says?

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:37.210
Look at 'em go!

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:46.260
Acrobats!

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:47.920
They're quite skilled, too.

00:06:58.040 --> 00:06:59.250
Three!

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:00.210
Two!

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:01.250
--One!

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:03.380
--Go, Shoot!

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:20.930
Wow!

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:24.210
So many pretty ladies!

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:28.580
Dirty old man!

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:31.290
You need to be in close
harmony to pull that off...

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:32.880
It's all show!

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:34.410
Come again?

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:40.740
Sorry. Compared to fighters like us
who've scarified so much for Beys,

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:42.340
You guys are nothing special.

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:43.620
Rai!

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:46.730
Sis!

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:49.940
What a strong-minded gal!

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:52.070
Why you...

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:53.780
What was that for?!

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:58.020
If you're gonna complain, why not see for
yourself how much of a "show" it is?!

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:02.440
Yeah, let's! It'll be a good
warm-up before the tournament!

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:08.440
Yum!

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:11.520
Spain's the best!
Paella's the best!

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:13.600
That's a lot of
food for breakfast...

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:16.520
I wonder if they've got
four stomachs like cows do...

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:23.410
Whassat?

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:28.420
Let me show you
what a real battle is!

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:29.570
Rai!

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:34.760
If you're so worried about your partner,
maybe you should help him out?

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:38.130
A four-man battle?

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:39.170
Let's do it!

00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:41.840
Go, Shoot!

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.240
That trick!

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:54.690
It's all a show!

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:57.820
Get back here!

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:03.820
What?!

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:04.860
Drat!

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:11.160
Too bad.

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:11.920
Darn!

00:09:20.730 --> 00:09:23.490
Get back here you
masked clowns!

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:24.980
Cool it, Rai!

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:31.700
Go, Galeon!

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:38.500
Don't follow!

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:50.010
You're all mine now!
Go, Galeon!

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:00.690
What?!

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:05.960
Rai, look out!

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:08.240
I'm not gonna
lose to clowns!

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:11.570
Gemini Attack! Ole!

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:28.130
This...

00:10:28.130 --> 00:10:29.970
Takao!

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:31.650
Rei!

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:33.540
I lost!

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:39.070
This means I...

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:42.130
Rai!

00:10:42.520 --> 00:10:48.320
I can't keep
dragging you down...

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:50.780
Rai! Rai!

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:58.970
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:03.930
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:11:18.180 --> 00:11:22.730
The tournament enters its third day! Neo-Borg is at one win and one loss!

00:11:22.730 --> 00:11:30.560
Kai unexpectedly lost his previous battle.
As usual, he leaves no comment for reporters!

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:36.280
Neo-Borg will be fighting
the PPB All Starz!

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:48.850
Will this undefeated team ride
the wave to another victory?!

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:53.440
The popular Barthez Soldat is
at one win and one loss!

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:57.490
Just follow my orders.

00:11:57.490 --> 00:12:03.530
Their opponents will the BBA Revolution, team of last year's world champ Takao Kinomiya!

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:08.560
There's a chance their coaches
might shake things up to get a win!

00:12:10.530 --> 00:12:12.940
But the champ
won't stay quiet!

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:19.020
With one win and one loss, the BBA
Revolution will need the champ at full power!

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:25.170
You'll approve our request
for a four-man battle?!

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:29.960
I will if the other
team approves of it.

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:32.000
--Thank you so much!
--Thank you so much!

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:35.890
Well, hold on.
It hasn't been approved yet.

00:12:35.890 --> 00:12:40.720
It only will once
your opponents accept.

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:44.610
I understand.
I'm sure they'll approve!

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:48.840
F-Sangre's at two losses!

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:54.650
They plan on using the home-court
advantage to get back in this thing!

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:01.570
Rai...

00:13:01.570 --> 00:13:04.810
They will fight Baihuzu,
which has one win and one loss!

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:08.900
Will they put a stop
to F-Sangre's comeback?!

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:20.010
Gimme that, monkey boy!

00:13:20.010 --> 00:13:22.140
Yeah right!

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:24.420
Buy your own!

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:28.140
Don't be so stingy!
I just wanna read it!

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:31.200
Daichi!

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:32.760
It was an accident!

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:34.660
That was my newspaper!

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:40.770
Oh, Rei!

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:43.050
Thank god...

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:49.240
Thanks!

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:51.170
You've got a good partner.

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:56.980
Daichi? All we do is fight!
And he never shuts up!

00:13:56.980 --> 00:13:59.810
Must be nice to be childhood friends with your partner.

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:03.140
Now that's a real partner!

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:05.850
A real partner...

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:10.770
A partner who won't
tell me the truth...

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:16.200
Why is he pushing
himself so hard?

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:19.060
We're all so worried
about his health, too.

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:20.480
Rei...

00:14:20.480 --> 00:14:23.740
Oh, it's nothing. The match
is about to start. See you!

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:27.050
Rei!

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:30.740
I don't get
the details, but...

00:14:30.740 --> 00:14:34.890
If you've got something
to say, you should say it!

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:40.520
Don't hold back. If you end up
fighting, that's just how it is!

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:43.660
On good enough
terms to fight?

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:45.820
Thank you, Takao.

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:47.090
Rei!

00:14:47.090 --> 00:14:47.930
What is it, Mao?

00:14:47.930 --> 00:14:50.340
Rai says he want to play!

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:52.420
He what?!

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:08.840
You can't. Not like this!

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:11.360
I'll fight for you, Rai!

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:13.410
I'm fine!

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:14.770
Rai!!

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:18.410
The fans are going wild.

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:20.620
This is F-Sangre's home after all.

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:23.130
I wonder if
Rai's gonna be okay?

00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:24.400
Rai...

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:25.810
Let's do this.

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:28.940
Here comes F-Sangre!

00:15:38.010 --> 00:15:39.180
It's you!

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:42.210
This is no place
for clowning around!

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:45.380
You should be grateful
for getting let off easy.

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:47.490
Since that wasn't
an official match!

00:15:47.490 --> 00:15:48.780
---What?!

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:54.290
The jugglers were F-Sangre?!

00:15:54.290 --> 00:15:55.970
That we are.

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:57.800
Time for revenge!

00:15:57.800 --> 00:16:01.360
Why not get your revenge in the
same four-man battle you lost?

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:03.780
If the rules allow it, sure!

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:07.730
Hear that, Chairman Daitenji?

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:12.320
Our opponents approve!
We're going to fight a four-man battle!

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:16.810
I will allow it if neither
party has an objection.

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.650
Good with you?

00:16:18.650 --> 00:16:19.800
Yeah!

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:22.720
Rai can follow me
in a four-man battle.

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:25.580
I've got to consider
how tired he is!

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.010
So you accept?

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:28.210
We do!

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:34.900
An early twist!
This four-man battle is on!

00:16:34.900 --> 00:16:41.400
And the stadium this time
is the Bull-Fighting Arena!

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:46.260
Allow me to
explain the rules!

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:49.940
When someone touches
the central circle...

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:53.730
They could be hit
by a powerful snort!

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:59.760
Let's get things started!

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:03.250
Three! Two! One!

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:05.750
Go, Shoot!

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:12.860
Running away?

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:14.160
Calm down, Rai!

00:17:15.140 --> 00:17:18.410
Time for an early Stadium Out!

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:24.640
Impressive!
What beautiful moves!

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:29.940
A perfect landing!

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:31.450
You won't escape!

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:33.900
It's a trap!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:36.560
Crap!

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:44.880
It's all over for Rai!

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:45.970
Rai!

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:47.880
Driger!

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:03.930
Rei made it in time!
Rai's in, but just barely!

00:18:04.090 --> 00:18:05.440
Oh no!

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:14.130
F-Sangre makes an
attack from every angle!

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:20.220
They even spin at the same rate!
I can't tell who'll make what move!

00:18:21.650 --> 00:18:23.370
It's all my fault...

00:18:23.890 --> 00:18:29.420
I talked so tough but now I'm dragging Rei down again...

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:30.260
Rai?

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:45.260
Rai's out of control!
What happened?!

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:48.410
Rai, calm down!

00:18:48.610 --> 00:18:50.080
Rai!

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:51.700
I'm a little scared...

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:56.850
I can sense it! Rai's anger
and pain toward himself...

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:59.140
What's happening?

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:00.320
What is...

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:01.880
It's all my fault!

00:19:01.880 --> 00:19:03.340
Calm down, Rai!

00:19:03.340 --> 00:19:06.220
It's my fault!

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:10.780
Rai's going to die!

00:19:10.780 --> 00:19:12.650
This has to end.

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:18.080
So powerful!

00:19:19.980 --> 00:19:21.210
Rai!

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:22.850
Driger!

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:29.650
Baihuzu's got an infight!

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:45.930
Rai!

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.610
F-Sangre wins!

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:53.320
Rai!

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:04.250
Rai...

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:05.650
Rai!

00:20:05.650 --> 00:20:07.680
Did we lose?

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:09.200
Sorry.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:11.210
It's all because of me...

00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:16.010
That's enough, Rai...

00:20:16.010 --> 00:20:17.320
Rei...

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:19.960
Mao, Gao, Kiki...

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:21.900
We're all worried about you!

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.850
You haven't slept at all.

00:20:23.850 --> 00:20:25.580
And you don't
have an appetite.

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:30.540
You pretended to be fine even though
all that practice wore you out...

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:35.930
I'm sorry, guys.
But I made a choice.

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:40.600
When I became Rei's partner,
I decided to never complain again!

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:42.400
Complain a little!

00:20:43.170 --> 00:20:45.450
We're partners, aren't we?!

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:46.610
Rei...

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:50.130
My heart hurt every time I
thought about how you felt!

00:20:50.130 --> 00:20:51.100
Rei...

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:52.500
Rai.

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:56.650
You may have had a
hard time, but so did Rei.

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:58.000
Master Tao!

00:20:58.720 --> 00:21:03.160
Enduring the hard times and
savoring the joyful times together...

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:07.840
Acknowledging each other's
feelings is what real partners do.

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:09.450
Right, Rei?

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:11.490
Real...

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:12.910
Partners...

00:21:13.130 --> 00:21:16.010
This loss was a valuable one.

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:18.520
Rei, you're a good team now!

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:19.620
Yes!

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:21.520
Rai...

00:21:21.520 --> 00:21:22.490
Rei!

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:25.000
Rai... Rei...

00:22:57.280 --> 00:22:59.140
Max Mizuhara.

00:23:00.660 --> 00:23:03.330
One of my greatest rivals.

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:07.690
Silence!

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:10.250
Be quiet and watch us.

00:23:11.610 --> 00:23:14.640
Don't interfere in our battle!

00:23:16.800 --> 00:23:20.920
Can you see the
stars shining above?
